# JAS Digital Works — configuration Apache (OVH « Free hosting », cluster129)
# Si le serveur renvoie une erreur 500, retirer ce fichier : le site
# fonctionne sans lui, seules les URLs sans extension et les en-têtes de
# sécurité sont perdus.

# --- HTTPS forcé ---------------------------------------------------------
RewriteEngine On
RewriteCond %{HTTPS} !=on
RewriteCond %{HTTP:X-Forwarded-Proto} !https
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://%{HTTP_HOST}/$1 [R=301,L]

# --- URLs sans extension : /tarifs sert tarifs.html ----------------------
Options -MultiViews
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d
RewriteCond %{DOCUMENT_ROOT}/$1.html -f
RewriteRule ^(.+?)/?$ $1.html [L]

DirectoryIndex index.html
ErrorDocument 404 /404.html

# --- Compression ---------------------------------------------------------
<IfModule mod_deflate.c>
  AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE text/html text/css text/plain text/xml application/javascript image/svg+xml
</IfModule>

# --- Cache ---------------------------------------------------------------
<IfModule mod_expires.c>
  ExpiresActive On
  ExpiresByType text/html "access plus 1 hour"
  ExpiresByType text/css "access plus 1 month"
  ExpiresByType application/javascript "access plus 1 month"
  ExpiresByType image/svg+xml "access plus 1 year"
  ExpiresByType image/png "access plus 1 year"
  ExpiresByType image/jpeg "access plus 1 year"
  ExpiresByType image/webp "access plus 1 year"
</IfModule>

# --- En-têtes de sécurité ------------------------------------------------
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header always set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
  Header always set X-Frame-Options "SAMEORIGIN"
  Header always set Referrer-Policy "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
  Header always set Permissions-Policy "geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=()"
  Header always set Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000"
</IfModule>

# --- Fichiers non servis -------------------------------------------------
<FilesMatch "^\.(htaccess|git)">
  Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
